WEBVTT

01:40.910 --> 01:45.710
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.350 --> 01:50.920
[Episode 27]

01:52.350 --> 01:53.070
Yuan.

01:53.560 --> 01:54.280
Yuan!

01:56.590 --> 01:57.310
Yuan.

02:04.540 --> 02:05.860
Classmate Zhang,

02:11.120 --> 02:15.800
I had this jade pendant custom-made for you.

02:17.710 --> 02:19.060
It's a bit childish.

02:21.750 --> 02:24.030
I hope you don't mind.

02:33.750 --> 02:34.960
Classmate Zhang.

02:38.680 --> 02:39.840
I don't want to...

02:42.590 --> 02:43.550
say

02:45.190 --> 02:46.710
goodbye to you.

02:46.730 --> 02:47.590
Yuan.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.190
Yuan.

02:49.430 --> 02:50.079
Yuan.

02:50.590 --> 02:51.280
Yuan!

02:51.630 --> 02:52.240
Yuan.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.000
Her heart meridian is still intact.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.960
Take her back to Ruyi Pavilion safely.

02:59.960 --> 03:00.490
Alright.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.400
I need some herbs.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.080
Okay.

03:10.630 --> 03:12.060
It's almost dark out.

03:12.120 --> 03:13.870
Why haven't they returned yet?

03:14.310 --> 03:16.040
The desert is vast and endless.

03:16.070 --> 03:17.710
If they can't find the antidote,

03:17.710 --> 03:19.670
My Lady...

03:20.190 --> 03:22.390
She has always been smart and cautious.

03:22.870 --> 03:24.560
How could she fall victim to demon poison?

03:24.560 --> 03:25.890
What exactly happened?

03:26.360 --> 03:27.840
You're the one who should answer that.

03:27.840 --> 03:30.880
My Lady's demon poison was transferred from you.

03:31.079 --> 03:31.960
You are simply

03:31.960 --> 03:33.760
the bane of My Lady's existence.

03:34.130 --> 03:35.220
What did you say?

03:35.590 --> 03:38.190
Master Zhang, your wicked mother

03:38.190 --> 03:40.310
poisoned you with the Nine-headed Bird's venom

03:40.310 --> 03:42.800
in order to control you with the demon-controlling talisman.

03:42.800 --> 03:44.840
That day when My Lady went to see you,

03:45.000 --> 03:46.329
the poison acted up

03:46.440 --> 03:48.100
and you collapsed before her.

03:48.190 --> 03:49.610
To save you,

03:49.680 --> 03:53.010
she took the demon poison into herself without hesitation.

03:53.310 --> 03:56.770
No wonder the demon-controlling talisman had no effect on me.

03:57.190 --> 03:58.680
All these years, My Lady

03:58.680 --> 04:00.430
has always liked you and wanted to see you.

04:00.430 --> 04:01.430
Do you really not know

04:01.430 --> 04:03.030
or are you just heartless?

04:05.430 --> 04:06.310
Master Zhang,

04:07.750 --> 04:09.080
do you know why My Lady

04:09.150 --> 04:11.350
didn't tell you about the demon poison?

04:11.840 --> 04:13.700
She said you've suffered enough.

04:13.840 --> 04:15.240
She didn't want you to feel guilty.

04:15.240 --> 04:18.300
She didn't want to become another burden on your heart.

04:25.920 --> 04:26.870
Are you alright?

04:26.950 --> 04:27.950
Get out.

04:43.800 --> 04:44.680
Yuan.

04:47.490 --> 04:50.820
Actually, from the moment you called me Classmate Zhang...

04:54.800 --> 04:56.400
I had already fallen for you.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.630
[Lotus Academy]

04:58.190 --> 04:59.190
Classmate Zhang.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.310
You've recovered

05:14.390 --> 05:16.520
and can even able to come to school now?

05:16.900 --> 05:19.470
[Lotus Academy]

05:18.040 --> 05:19.840
Good morning, Classmate Zhang.

05:21.320 --> 05:22.550
I'll go in first.

05:21.410 --> 05:23.230
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

05:24.040 --> 05:26.500
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

05:27.110 --> 05:30.750
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

05:31.390 --> 05:32.470
Good morning...

05:31.980 --> 05:36.240
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

05:36.020 --> 05:36.970
Yuan.

05:37.290 --> 05:41.250
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

05:40.950 --> 05:43.210
Asparagus wontons, a treat for you.

05:42.420 --> 05:44.320
♪ We're fully committed ♪

05:44.960 --> 05:46.760
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

05:47.780 --> 05:51.590
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

05:49.900 --> 05:50.990
Try it.

05:52.360 --> 05:54.580
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

05:52.740 --> 05:53.500
Quickly.

05:55.070 --> 05:57.380
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

05:58.480 --> 06:02.610
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

06:04.630 --> 06:09.070
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

06:09.710 --> 06:12.310
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

06:12.730 --> 06:14.720
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

06:15.460 --> 06:17.420
♪ Time goes by ♪

06:17.960 --> 06:19.940
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

06:20.680 --> 06:24.110
♪ But our love remains still ♪

06:25.640 --> 06:30.020
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

06:30.770 --> 06:31.800
Classmate Zhang.

06:30.920 --> 06:33.480
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

06:34.000 --> 06:35.630
Where are you going?

06:34.190 --> 06:36.090
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

06:36.620 --> 06:38.290
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

06:39.030 --> 06:40.770
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

06:41.470 --> 06:45.060
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

06:49.250 --> 06:50.250
Classmate Zhang.

06:52.610 --> 06:53.670
See you tomorrow!

06:55.120 --> 06:55.870
Yuan.

06:57.270 --> 06:58.190
Goodbye.

07:00.240 --> 07:01.590
Farewell forever.

07:06.870 --> 07:08.770
♪ We're fully committed ♪

07:07.600 --> 07:08.390
Yuan.

07:09.410 --> 07:11.310
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

07:11.480 --> 07:13.110
Let's go back to that day.

07:12.230 --> 07:16.120
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

07:14.460 --> 07:16.240
Can we not say goodbye?

07:16.580 --> 07:19.060
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

07:19.410 --> 07:20.590
All these years,

07:19.640 --> 07:21.810
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

07:22.680 --> 07:24.160
I've been avoiding you,

07:22.790 --> 07:27.110
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

07:24.720 --> 07:25.980
staying away from you.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.280
I focused on my training,

07:29.080 --> 07:33.520
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

07:29.430 --> 07:32.890
wanting to become the so-called world's greatest swordsman.

07:34.159 --> 07:36.580
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

07:34.200 --> 07:36.420
I thought my heart was as hard as a rock.

07:37.180 --> 07:39.140
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

07:39.909 --> 07:41.860
♪ Time goes by ♪

07:40.470 --> 07:43.680
But in reality, your name was already engraved in it.

07:42.620 --> 07:44.460
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

07:45.130 --> 07:48.570
♪ But our love remains still ♪

07:45.330 --> 07:48.920
Ms. Qingmu's reputation spreads far and wide.

07:50.090 --> 07:54.470
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

07:50.970 --> 07:53.500
So many people are jealous and try to harm you,

07:54.680 --> 07:56.390
yet no one has ever succeeded.

07:55.100 --> 07:57.650
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

07:58.300 --> 08:00.310
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

07:59.760 --> 08:01.410
Do you know why?

08:00.770 --> 08:02.690
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

08:03.220 --> 08:05.110
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

08:05.730 --> 08:09.170
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

08:08.110 --> 08:10.580
Because I'm always behind you,

08:12.600 --> 08:14.550
not letting anyone hurt you.

08:17.800 --> 08:19.860
Actually, I went to see you every year

08:22.720 --> 08:24.280
on your birthday.

08:29.410 --> 08:32.320
The food I love most in this life is wontons.

08:32.400 --> 08:36.460
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

08:36.510 --> 08:37.750
Wake up.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.980
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

08:40.460 --> 08:42.669
Can you give me another chance?

08:40.650 --> 08:42.659
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

08:43.320 --> 08:44.990
♪ The past vanishes ♪

08:45.490 --> 08:47.340
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

08:48.100 --> 08:51.990
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

09:14.600 --> 09:15.510
Huaizhu,

09:15.680 --> 09:17.540
these few herbs are almost ready.

09:17.950 --> 09:21.350
We just need a catalyst that can neutralize the demon poison.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.510
Can those two bring it back?

09:25.120 --> 09:25.870
They can.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.580
Hongye and Quzhuo

09:28.960 --> 09:29.890
definitely can.

09:31.720 --> 09:35.510
The udumbara flower stamen is a once-in-a-century occurrence.

09:36.120 --> 09:39.440
It's guarded by fierce beasts too.

10:17.270 --> 10:18.120
You're awake.

10:26.850 --> 10:28.180
My demon poison

10:28.720 --> 10:29.600
has been cured?

10:31.870 --> 10:34.930
Huaizhu and Hongye found the antidote for you.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.510
Where are they?

10:39.200 --> 10:41.530
They were afraid of disturbing your rest.

10:41.760 --> 10:44.090
They said they'd come to see you tomorrow.

10:47.480 --> 10:49.280
I have a bitter taste in my mouth.

10:49.440 --> 10:51.100
Good medicine tastes bitter.

10:55.240 --> 10:57.200
How about next time I ask her to use

10:57.200 --> 10:58.460
less bitter medicine?

11:02.020 --> 11:03.660
Master Zhang, would you please

11:03.660 --> 11:06.190
bring me the preserved fruits from the table?

11:09.910 --> 11:10.670
Also,

11:11.710 --> 11:13.110
bring the mirror too.

11:13.710 --> 11:14.310
Alright.

11:30.390 --> 11:31.050
Here you go.

11:38.690 --> 11:41.180
My complexion looks terrible.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.030
You've lost weight.

11:46.260 --> 11:47.260
I've lost weight?

11:51.200 --> 11:53.060
You've had a close call this time.

11:53.730 --> 11:55.460
You can't lose any more weight.

12:22.600 --> 12:24.590
I don't have the energy to talk.

12:25.390 --> 12:26.720
How about

12:27.720 --> 12:28.910
you talk to me instead?

12:28.910 --> 12:29.710
You're tired.

12:30.950 --> 12:32.000
Get some rest early.

12:32.000 --> 12:32.750
No.

12:33.940 --> 12:35.380
I want to hear you talk.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.000
What should I say?

12:39.020 --> 12:40.410
Your voice is pretty.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.270
Anything will do.

12:43.150 --> 12:44.720
Then I'll recite a calming mantra for you

12:44.720 --> 12:45.550
to help you sleep.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.440
No.

12:49.330 --> 12:52.940
I'm now your lifesaver, in a way.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.300
How do you want to repay me?

12:57.080 --> 12:59.210
Any kind of repayment you want is fine.

13:05.440 --> 13:06.360
Zhang Zheng.

13:06.970 --> 13:07.890
Let me tell you.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.440
I like you.

13:11.210 --> 13:13.310
I don't need any repayment from you.

13:14.740 --> 13:16.940
You're powerful and strong in my heart.

13:18.610 --> 13:20.350
You don't owe anyone anything.

13:20.670 --> 13:22.630
You've already done very well.

13:24.150 --> 13:25.210
Do you understand?

13:34.090 --> 13:35.660
Do you understand me or not?

13:50.000 --> 13:51.860
I won't be like this anymore.

13:53.870 --> 13:54.720
Don't worry.

13:56.390 --> 13:58.650
I'm clinging onto you for this lifetime.

13:59.280 --> 14:01.390
Even if you get annoyed with me in the future,

14:01.390 --> 14:02.450
or grow tired of me,

14:04.480 --> 14:06.540
I'll always be clinging to you.

14:24.360 --> 14:25.120
Yuan,

14:26.630 --> 14:28.290
for this lifetime and beyond,

14:32.600 --> 14:34.060
you're the only one for me.

14:36.890 --> 14:38.260
Do you mean it?

14:39.030 --> 14:39.840
Yes.

14:41.590 --> 14:43.150
Give me a kiss.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.770
Then I'll believe you.

14:59.450 --> 15:01.190
♪ The tall trees are intertwined ♪

15:01.680 --> 15:03.050
♪ You are so close to me ♪

15:03.630 --> 15:06.350
♪ In the wind and moonlight, my amorous feelings linger ♪

15:07.030 --> 15:08.920
♪ You gallop on horseback ♪

15:09.240 --> 15:10.850
♪ As if you came as soon as you heard the news ♪

15:11.250 --> 15:14.070
♪ You want to rekindle the stars in my eyes ♪

15:14.640 --> 15:16.400
♪ Through the troubled times filled with beacon fires and chaos ♪

15:16.680 --> 15:18.060
♪ We watch the spring blossoms and autumn fruits ♪

15:18.830 --> 15:21.790
♪ Only you make me feel at ease ♪

15:22.340 --> 15:24.210
♪ I want to ♪

15:24.740 --> 15:26.350
♪ Look into your eyes day after day ♪

15:26.900 --> 15:29.930
♪ But my heartfelt words are hidden behind my lips ♪

15:30.520 --> 15:33.410
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

15:33.930 --> 15:37.020
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

15:38.620 --> 15:40.980
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

15:42.060 --> 15:44.310
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

15:46.520 --> 15:47.760
♪ Time slips away ♪

15:48.720 --> 15:51.600
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

15:52.540 --> 15:55.910
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

15:57.110 --> 16:00.100
♪ We are all the same ♪

16:02.000 --> 16:04.400
What's making you so happy you can't sleep?

16:04.890 --> 16:06.080
Bumu has become

16:06.080 --> 16:07.910
the new ruler of the Beast Kingdom.

16:07.910 --> 16:10.490
He invited us to go to the dungeon with him tomorrow.

16:10.490 --> 16:11.960
That's truly good news.

16:18.480 --> 16:19.170
Oh, right.

16:20.240 --> 16:22.440
Quzhuo taught me something.

16:22.550 --> 16:24.890
Quzhuo? Taught you?

16:25.030 --> 16:25.840
He said...

16:27.750 --> 16:28.550
Wait a moment.

16:30.440 --> 16:32.170
There seems to be something...

16:32.500 --> 16:34.410
Is it a small bug or a loose thread?

16:35.120 --> 16:36.520
Let me take a look for you.

17:00.360 --> 17:03.750
Is this what Quzhuo taught you?

17:07.619 --> 17:08.750
Then I'll go ask him.

17:10.400 --> 17:11.880
If you go ask him now,

17:12.550 --> 17:14.010
he'll certainly admit it.

17:35.650 --> 17:36.990
You failed.

17:39.580 --> 17:41.890
Jiuhuo, I can't believe you failed.

17:50.880 --> 17:52.640
I admit I was careless this time.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.680
Careless?

17:54.510 --> 17:56.810
They were supposed to have only one fate,

17:56.840 --> 17:59.130
which was to be crushed under my feet.

17:59.390 --> 18:01.260
But because of your negligence,

18:01.550 --> 18:04.510
not only did Dongfang Huaizhu obtain the Twilight Mist Flower,

18:04.510 --> 18:06.160
but Wangquan Hongye also gained

18:06.160 --> 18:08.270
the power to destroy me beyond the Boundary.

18:08.270 --> 18:11.400
If you were still the powerful Lord Jiuhuo you once were,

18:11.590 --> 18:13.510
none of this would have happened.

18:13.790 --> 18:16.070
You would have annihilated them in one fell swoop,

18:16.070 --> 18:17.920
instead of hiding here in Sky City,

18:17.920 --> 18:19.400
helpless against them.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.930
The solar eclipse is approaching.

18:24.790 --> 18:26.340
I will find a way

18:26.750 --> 18:28.640
to break the connection between the Black Grief Tree

18:28.640 --> 18:30.870
and the Grief Tree,

18:31.400 --> 18:35.000
so you can obtain the power of the Grief Tree within the Boundary.

18:35.510 --> 18:36.550
But...

18:38.830 --> 18:41.400
But you are already very weak.

18:41.790 --> 18:44.920
This action will consume a great deal of demonic energy.

18:45.240 --> 18:46.680
As long as you can return,

18:48.310 --> 18:49.880
I will spare no effort.

18:52.750 --> 18:53.960
I'm sorry.

18:55.000 --> 18:57.550
Forgive me for losing my temper with you earlier.

18:57.550 --> 18:59.930
I can't bear to see you so weak.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.210
Love makes one panic.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.170
After all...

19:04.540 --> 19:07.600
After all, you are the Lord Jiuhuo I care about the most.

19:08.260 --> 19:09.230
Tell me,

19:10.000 --> 19:11.440
are you still waiting for me?

19:11.440 --> 19:13.170
Don't be silly.

19:15.640 --> 19:16.680
I promise you.

19:18.240 --> 19:20.270
I will definitely bring you back.

19:22.030 --> 19:22.880
Okay.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.640
I believe you.

19:25.720 --> 19:26.790
Lord Jiuhuo,

19:27.640 --> 19:28.510
remember,

19:29.550 --> 19:31.210
we can't afford to lose again.

20:00.610 --> 20:02.720
After all these years at Mount Xuankong,

20:02.720 --> 20:04.570
is this all you've learned?

20:04.990 --> 20:06.050
Just you wait.

20:37.530 --> 20:38.940
You've lost again.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.030
I...

21:08.880 --> 21:09.680
Jia Lan.

21:12.110 --> 21:13.960
You're trying to manipulate me?

21:14.030 --> 21:14.750
I'm not.

21:15.680 --> 21:17.520
Lord Jiuhuo, you're so powerful.

21:17.520 --> 21:18.750
I wouldn't dare to.

21:21.570 --> 21:23.770
But you've really improved this time.

21:23.970 --> 21:25.900
I have a gift for you.

21:27.030 --> 21:27.880
What gift?

21:31.310 --> 21:32.310
A little fox!

21:40.030 --> 21:41.210
Lord Jiuhuo,

21:41.720 --> 21:43.510
I've also prepared a gift for you.

21:43.510 --> 21:44.540
Would you like to see it?

21:44.080 --> 21:48.310
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

21:45.720 --> 21:46.310
Let's go.

21:47.550 --> 21:48.270
Come on.

21:49.470 --> 21:51.790
♪ It melts in your ♪

21:52.860 --> 21:55.370
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

21:58.260 --> 22:02.430
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

22:03.630 --> 22:05.540
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

22:06.730 --> 22:09.570
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

22:08.590 --> 22:10.120
Beautiful and mysterious.

22:11.070 --> 22:12.590
Indeed, quite interesting.

22:11.930 --> 22:13.770
♪ I used to be like the wind, searching ♪

22:14.070 --> 22:15.270
♪ Every nook and cranny ♪

22:15.720 --> 22:17.340
♪ And I was once like water, asking ♪

22:17.520 --> 22:18.490
♪ Every lake ♪

22:18.990 --> 22:20.640
♪ I swallow the growing thorns ♪

22:21.130 --> 22:22.990
♪ Lost in love's bitter toll ♪

22:22.480 --> 22:23.480
My Lord, look.

22:24.160 --> 22:26.000
♪ Yet I heard the pulse ♪

22:26.930 --> 22:30.020
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

22:30.870 --> 22:33.610
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

22:31.550 --> 22:33.440
I've always been asking myself,

22:34.590 --> 22:36.950
♪ And love drowns me ♪

22:35.030 --> 22:36.550
at which moment

22:36.960 --> 22:38.830
did I develop feelings for Jia Lan?

22:38.040 --> 22:41.040
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

22:39.870 --> 22:42.750
Was it from the moment she grew up?

22:41.900 --> 22:44.520
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

22:45.380 --> 22:48.160
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

22:45.640 --> 22:47.100
Since you like it, My Lord,

22:48.050 --> 22:51.740
I'll offer you its most beautiful moment.

22:48.780 --> 22:50.090
♪ If I can look ♪

22:50.900 --> 22:53.760
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

22:54.590 --> 22:56.840
♪ And falling ♪

23:06.510 --> 23:07.770
Do you like it, My Lord?

23:13.830 --> 23:16.500
Or was it when she used this cruel method

23:16.620 --> 23:18.590
to preserve beauty for me?

23:21.960 --> 23:23.240
Or perhaps...

23:30.920 --> 23:33.680
Lord Jiuhuo, what's wrong?

23:33.830 --> 23:36.090
The Dragon Clan and our Netherworld Clan

23:36.160 --> 23:37.510
are mortal enemies.

23:37.680 --> 23:39.720
They've been trespassing frequently lately.

23:39.720 --> 23:41.910
I went to raid their lair.

23:43.270 --> 23:44.480
You went alone

23:44.920 --> 23:46.960
to raid the Dragon Clan's lair?

23:47.660 --> 23:49.440
The True Dragon Clan has been destroyed.

23:49.440 --> 23:52.430
Unfortunately, the Dragon King escaped.

23:53.590 --> 23:55.670
My Lord, My Lord!

23:59.640 --> 24:00.750
I'm a bit tired.

24:01.750 --> 24:03.680
I want to rest for a while.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.680
Alright.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.600
His demon core is shattered.

24:22.550 --> 24:26.080
Or maybe it started when she, who had always been cold-blooded,

24:26.680 --> 24:29.820
guarded me for three days and nights.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.120
Jia Lan.

25:29.200 --> 25:30.610
Lord Jiuhuo.

25:29.480 --> 25:33.280
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

25:31.830 --> 25:33.050
Look.

25:34.430 --> 25:35.550
This is...

25:34.660 --> 25:36.890
♪ It melts in your ♪

25:36.000 --> 25:37.660
This is the Dragon Emperor's?

25:37.810 --> 25:40.350
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

25:38.440 --> 25:40.240
I took his dragon core.

25:41.960 --> 25:43.240
It's still warm.

25:43.420 --> 25:47.390
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

25:45.790 --> 25:47.590
I offer it to you.

25:48.630 --> 25:50.470
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

25:51.310 --> 25:54.560
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

25:57.060 --> 25:58.870
♪ I was once like a stubborn flower ♪

25:58.230 --> 25:59.510
You slayed

25:59.500 --> 26:00.390
♪ Blooming in the desert ♪

26:00.840 --> 26:02.410
♪ The withered grass extinguished ♪

26:00.920 --> 26:02.230
a dragon for me?

26:02.830 --> 26:03.960
I said before

26:02.940 --> 26:03.780
♪ The flames of the eternal night ♪

26:04.330 --> 26:05.890
♪ The thorns all over the body illuminate ♪

26:04.790 --> 26:07.390
that those who dare to hurt Lord Jiuhuo

26:06.390 --> 26:08.510
♪ Love's bitter toll ♪

26:08.120 --> 26:09.870
all must die.

26:09.450 --> 26:11.170
♪ Piercing through all the tenderness ♪

26:12.170 --> 26:15.230
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

26:13.350 --> 26:14.240
Jia Lan.

26:16.000 --> 26:16.820
Jia Lan.

26:16.110 --> 26:18.940
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

26:16.880 --> 26:17.810
Or perhaps...

26:19.310 --> 26:19.980
Jia Lan!

26:19.830 --> 26:22.260
♪ And love drowns me ♪

26:21.370 --> 26:23.720
It was from the moment she slayed a dragon for me.

26:23.270 --> 26:26.340
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

26:27.140 --> 26:29.710
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

26:30.620 --> 26:33.500
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

26:34.020 --> 26:35.500
♪ If I can look ♪

26:36.120 --> 26:38.820
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

26:40.070 --> 26:43.390
♪ And falling ♪

26:45.400 --> 26:48.240
Isn't today's sunset and rainbow beautiful?

26:48.400 --> 26:50.600
I don't like sunsets and rainbows.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.200
Isn't the night good?

26:52.400 --> 26:54.680
Only the night is eternal.

27:04.550 --> 27:06.810
My Lord's demonic energy has recovered.

27:08.600 --> 27:11.160
The spiritual energy of the dragon core has repaired my demon core.

27:11.160 --> 27:12.240
Our Jia Lan,

27:12.790 --> 27:13.920
you've worked hard.

27:15.270 --> 27:16.000
My Lord,

27:16.350 --> 27:18.110
then can I have a reward?

27:19.070 --> 27:19.960
Certainly.

27:26.590 --> 27:28.030
It's been a long time since you've

27:28.030 --> 27:30.110
combed my hair.

27:39.590 --> 27:41.850
Why did you slay the dragon without permission?

27:41.850 --> 27:43.340
I like the strong.

27:44.110 --> 27:46.270
Anyone who stands in your way

27:46.570 --> 27:47.510
must die.

27:48.290 --> 27:51.170
Then if one day I'm no longer strong,

27:52.920 --> 27:55.350
will you treat me like a butterfly

27:56.550 --> 27:58.880
and let me die at my most beautiful moment?

28:08.440 --> 28:10.270
You're my Lord Jiuhuo.

28:11.400 --> 28:13.160
How can you die?

28:20.830 --> 28:23.430
You've slain the last true dragon in the world.

28:24.030 --> 28:26.490
Neither humans nor demons will forgive you.

28:27.330 --> 28:28.620
So what?

28:30.550 --> 28:31.310
Indeed.

28:32.730 --> 28:34.040
So what?

28:35.590 --> 28:37.920
If anyone dares to question or oppose you,

28:39.030 --> 28:40.680
we'll just kill them.

28:46.600 --> 28:49.170
It wasn't actually at any particular moment.

28:49.670 --> 28:51.730
When I discovered there was

28:51.920 --> 28:54.720
another being as dangerous as myself in this world

28:54.880 --> 28:57.160
and she entered my world,

28:57.590 --> 28:58.440
we had

28:59.220 --> 29:01.370
already become inseparable.

29:01.720 --> 29:03.550
Even if I'm shattered to pieces,

29:05.440 --> 29:07.790
I will definitely fulfill my promise.

29:09.270 --> 29:11.070
I will also protect your safety.

29:12.250 --> 29:13.390
When you return,

29:14.000 --> 29:16.000
I will roam freely with you.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.610
How about that?

29:32.240 --> 29:34.970
Prince, congratulations on becoming the ruler.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.860
I know.

29:42.240 --> 29:45.880
The Yiqi Alliance shouldn't interfere in the affairs of the Beast Kingdom.

29:45.880 --> 29:48.250
But Bumu, you understand the demon race.

29:48.680 --> 29:50.540
You should understand how I feel.

29:51.070 --> 29:53.720
The demons in the Beast Kingdom are living in misery.

29:53.720 --> 29:56.270
I hope they can have freedom one day.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.680
And with you becoming the ruler,

29:58.960 --> 30:01.590
perhaps that day will truly come.

30:08.590 --> 30:10.620
I have no intentions for the Beast Kingdom.

30:10.620 --> 30:11.880
Entering this secret chamber,

30:11.880 --> 30:12.920
I absolutely won't do

30:12.920 --> 30:15.120
anything harmful to the Beast Kingdom.

30:15.580 --> 30:18.770
I simply want to know the origin of the Black Fox.

30:29.720 --> 30:30.750
I trust you.

30:32.000 --> 30:33.400
The ruler's royal seal is

30:33.510 --> 30:35.680
the only key open this secret chamber.

30:52.160 --> 30:52.960
Follow me.

30:59.550 --> 31:02.810
Only the ruler can enter this secret chamber.

31:03.240 --> 31:04.110
Look,

31:04.510 --> 31:05.880
the inscriptions on these walls

31:05.880 --> 31:08.140
record the history of the Beast Kingdom.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.790
This includes...

31:09.790 --> 31:12.450
The origin of the demon-controlling talisman.

31:14.200 --> 31:17.790
Could the people in this painting be Jia Lan and Jiuhuo?

31:19.440 --> 31:20.240
No wonder Jiuhuo

31:20.240 --> 31:23.370
was unwilling to recall everything that happened here.

31:24.030 --> 31:25.750
Jiuhuo obtained the dragon core

31:25.750 --> 31:27.350
and should have become invincible.

31:27.350 --> 31:28.410
But unexpectedly,

31:28.580 --> 31:29.680
the Northern Hill Elder

31:29.680 --> 31:31.910
dug up the remains of two dragons.

31:31.960 --> 31:34.350
He used resentment to turn it against Jiuhuo

31:34.350 --> 31:38.050
and trapped him in an extremely cruel way.

32:01.830 --> 32:03.050
Lord Jiuhuo.

32:07.590 --> 32:08.590
Jia Lan.

32:09.920 --> 32:11.070
I came too late.

32:11.830 --> 32:13.560
Who told you to come?

32:14.200 --> 32:15.310
Leave quickly.

32:21.030 --> 32:22.130
Don't worry.

32:24.590 --> 32:25.880
We'll leave together.

32:28.240 --> 32:29.030
Jia Lan.

33:35.790 --> 33:39.440
What a devoted couple, sharing weal and woe.

33:40.110 --> 33:41.240
Unfortunately,

33:41.400 --> 33:43.550
neither of you will be leaving today.

33:44.790 --> 33:46.020
Who are you all?

33:46.200 --> 33:47.970
Allow me to introduce myself.

33:48.110 --> 33:50.220
[Old King of Beast Kingdom]

33:48.350 --> 33:50.280
I am the ruler of the Beast Kingdom.

33:51.030 --> 33:51.960
And this

33:52.200 --> 33:53.880
is the once-in-a-millennium

33:53.880 --> 33:55.940
prodigy in formation and rune magic,

33:56.160 --> 33:57.790
the Northern Hill Elder.

33:56.350 --> 33:57.990
[Northern Hill Elder]

34:01.130 --> 34:02.600
Do you like it here?

34:03.160 --> 34:04.030
This place

34:05.000 --> 34:08.989
was specially prepared for an esteemed guest like you.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.560
So it's you.

34:11.480 --> 34:12.500
Jia Lan.

34:13.520 --> 34:15.780
How dare you treat Lord Jiuhuo like this?

34:16.330 --> 34:17.900
You'll all die today!

34:22.889 --> 34:23.639
Jia Lan!

34:49.320 --> 34:50.500
Lord Jiuhuo!

34:50.850 --> 34:51.690
Run.

34:53.960 --> 34:54.760
Run!

34:54.760 --> 34:55.820
Lord Jiuhuo!

34:56.630 --> 34:57.530
Jia Lan!

35:01.030 --> 35:01.840
Jia Lan!

35:04.360 --> 35:06.590
The ruler has brilliant strategy.

35:06.760 --> 35:07.930
To capture you,

35:08.150 --> 35:11.350
he buried thousands of demons alive in this pit,

35:11.510 --> 35:16.280
and used the blood of the demons you killed
to activate the formation.

35:18.900 --> 35:20.920
How about that, little fox?

35:21.150 --> 35:23.160
Even if you can slay dragons,

35:23.230 --> 35:27.220
you can't break free from this formation of 10,000 spirits.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.070
Jia Lan!

36:06.110 --> 36:06.920
Jia Lan.

36:09.840 --> 36:10.800
Jia Lan!

36:15.600 --> 36:17.660
I won't let you get away with this.

36:19.080 --> 36:20.870
Fire of All Spirits.

36:20.900 --> 36:24.510
Today, we offer this evil fox as a sacrifice

36:24.550 --> 36:27.870
in exchange for the power to control demons!

36:28.130 --> 36:29.100
Jia Lan.

36:30.000 --> 36:30.840
Jia Lan!

36:36.760 --> 36:37.800
Jia Lan!

37:08.920 --> 37:09.880
No.

37:10.660 --> 37:11.580
No.

37:13.750 --> 37:14.830
Jia Lan!

37:33.710 --> 37:34.550
No.

37:43.090 --> 37:44.440
My Lord.

37:46.230 --> 37:47.110
No.

37:47.740 --> 37:48.570
No.

37:59.220 --> 38:00.860
My Lord.

38:31.100 --> 38:32.960
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

38:33.170 --> 38:34.920
We have obtained the demon blood.

38:34.920 --> 38:36.880
The demon-controlling talisman can now be created.

38:36.880 --> 38:41.370
You can now control demons and conquer the world.

38:41.670 --> 38:42.510
I

38:43.510 --> 38:45.710
killed this little demon girl
mentioned in the Tushan prophecy,

38:45.710 --> 38:48.240
who could destroy heaven and earth.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.800
We carried out heaven's will.

38:51.590 --> 38:53.720
The power to control demons within her

38:54.510 --> 38:58.860
shall be considered a reward from heaven for me.

38:59.440 --> 39:03.840
One by one, you all will die!

39:43.730 --> 39:45.150
Lord Jiuhuo,

39:45.920 --> 39:47.030
please forgive me.

39:48.650 --> 39:53.130
I won't be able to return to Mount Xuankong with you this time.
